title: "ScoreMe"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-01-01
url: "https://github.com/circadia-bio/ScoreMe"
repository-code: "https://github.com/circadia-bio/ScoreMe"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  A cross-platform research questionnaire scorer for administering and
  scoring 25 validated clinical and sleep health questionnaires across
  multiple research participants. Built with React Native and Expo,
  running as a web app, iOS app, and Android app from the same codebase.
